216
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:51,000
Can't we just go back?

217
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:53,340
Stop laughing and follow me.

218
00:16:53,340 --> 00:16:53,780
Hurry.

219
00:17:02,590 --> 00:17:03,670
Fools.

220
00:17:04,070 --> 00:17:05,170
