243
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:31,780
Go ahead.

244
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:32,580
Okay.

245
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:05,390
Let's go.

246
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:55,100
