256
00:22:27,120 --> 00:22:28,000
An alien?

257
00:22:28,660 --> 00:22:31,860
But why do you live in such a dark and scary cave?

258
00:22:33,660 --> 00:22:35,860
I was a scientist in Aria.

259
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:41,120
But I fell in love with Joanna, who started my research.

260
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:42,420
I fell in love with her.

261
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:47,160
I was sent to Aria.

262
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:50,620
It was already 999 years ago.

263
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:52,520
What?

264
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:55,640
999 years?

265
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:56,980
That's right.

266
00:22:57,820 --> 00:22:59,940
Now my research is at the final stage.

267
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:05,980
If I complete the first-person view of this Aria,

268
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:08,660
I can go back to Aria.

269
00:23:08,660 --> 00:23:12,480
But my body is running out of energy.

270
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,480
So I went out to find energy.

271
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:17,920
