284
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,300
Before you get exposed to Joanna,

285
00:24:07,300 --> 00:24:11,900
if you can find the energy charge material...

286
00:24:14,420 --> 00:24:15,780
I'll try.

287
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:20,880
If you can find that material,

288
00:24:22,340 --> 00:24:24,700
I'll give you the energy of a powerful super-missile.

289
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:30,900
What's that material?

290
00:24:33,340 --> 00:24:34,820
I don't know what kind of material on Earth

291
00:24:34,820 --> 00:24:36,240
can release that energy.

292
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:39,280
I don't know.

293
00:24:39,280 --> 00:24:41,300
